<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="cat-bs-71d4-a93c-4f20-8b61" name="Blackshields" revision="4" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="sys-6f3a-91d2-b47c-5e08" gameSystemRevision="15" type="catalogue">
  <comment>Standalone Blackshields catalogue. Generic Legion units are linked from Legiones Astartes; Blackshield-specific configuration and units are local.</comment>
  <catalogueLinks>
    <catalogueLink id="bs3-legiones-link" name="Legiones Astartes" hidden="false" targetId="cat-7b24-e6f1-83a9-4c50" importRootEntries="false" />
  </catalogueLinks>
  <selectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Blackshields Configuration" id="config-army" hidden="false" import="true">
      <modifiers />
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="config-army-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" automatic="true" />
        <constraint id="config-army-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
      </costs>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink targetId="cat-config" id="config-army-cat" primary="true" name="Configuration" hidden="false" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule id="r34-supplement-banner" name="Supplementary Units — Opponent Agreement" hidden="false">
          <description>Lords of War and Aeronautica are supplementary choices. Before the battle, agree with your opponent whether these units are permitted and whether your mission, event, or agreed game size imposes any additional restrictions.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="bs4-config-rule" name="Blackshields Detachment" hidden="false">
          <description>This Detachment is Legiones Astartes (Blackshields). Choose exactly one Oath of Moment and one Allegiance. Blackshield-specific access and restrictions are determined by that Oath.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r71-bs-oaths" name="Oath of Moment — choose exactly one" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="r71-bs-oath-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
            <constraint id="r71-bs-oath-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-oath-death" name="Death Seekers" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-oath-death-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-oath-death-rule" name="Death Seekers" hidden="false">
                  <description>Inured to Pain: non-vehicle Blackshields gain Feel No Pain (6+) and automatically pass Casualty and Pinning tests caused by enemy shooting. The Lure of Battle: they may never voluntarily fail Morale or Break tests; an unengaged unit voluntarily moving farther from the closest visible enemy must pass Leadership or instead move D6 inches toward that enemy, subject to the stated exceptions.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-oath-orphans" name="Orphans of War" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-oath-orphans-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-oath-orphans-rule" name="Orphans of War" hidden="false">
                  <description>Brothers Before Masters: while within 6 inches of another friendly Blackshield unit of at least five models, gain +1 Ld (max 10) and re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in Shooting and Assault. Use the unit own Leadership for Morale/Pinning/Break tests; failed Break after losing combat removes D3 additional models before Retreat. Blackshield Characters gain Preferred Enemy against enemy Independent Characters while in base contact. No Chaplains, Agents of the Sigillite, Agents of the Warmaster, or Allied Detachment containing a Primarch.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-oath-outlanders" name="Outlanders" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-oath-outlanders-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-oath-outlanders-rule" name="Outlanders" hidden="false">
                  <description>Void Reavers: before deployment, up to half of eligible Blackshield Infantry units without a Dedicated Transport may gain Deep Strike and enter Reserve; after a Deep Strike Mishap remove D3 models after resolving it. Unsanctioned Weaponry unlocks permitted Xenos equipment and Rad Grenades for Blackshield Characters. Shadow of Oblivion applies once at least half the starting Blackshield units are destroyed or Broken.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-oath-alien" name="The Alien Brotherhood" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-oath-alien-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-oath-alien-rule" name="The Alien Brotherhood" hidden="false">
                  <description>Unlikely Allies permits an Eldar Allied Detachment as trusted allies and excludes other Allied Detachments. Forbidden Arsenals grants full access to the Xenos Wargear/Weapons presented in the supplement for eligible models. One Blackshield Librarian may replace one normal psychic power with Doom, Guide, Mind War or Eldritch Storm. No Chaplains, Agents of the Sigillite or Agents of the Warmaster.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-oath-ashes" name="Ashes of the Armoury" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-oath-ashes-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-oath-ashes-rule" name="Ashes of the Armoury" hidden="false">
                  <description>Desperate Warriors: non-vehicle Blackshields gain Furious Charge; non-vehicle models selected from the Legiones Astartes Army List cost 2 points less per model, minimum 1. Scarce Ammunition: each Blackshield unit begins with two Ammunition counters and expends one after firing ammunition-fed weapons; at zero it cannot fire them. Las/energy weapons and vehicles are unaffected. Scavengers unlocks listed las weapons. The Last Magazine grants +1 Ld while charging or engaged after ammunition is exhausted.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="bs2-ashes-cost-note" name="Ashes points implementation" hidden="false">
                  <description>Furious Charge, ammunition and las access are active in this catalogue. The -2 points per non-vehicle model clause is retained as a rules requirement and is not yet automatically subtracted from every generic unit entry in R2; apply it when checking the roster total until the per-model modifier audit is complete.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="bs4-ashes-note" name="Ashes points implementation" hidden="false">
                  <description>R4 implements the Oath rules and scavenged las access. The -2 points per non-vehicle model discount remains a roster-level adjustment pending a safe per-model modifier pass; do not treat the displayed subtotal as final when using this Oath.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-oath-chymeriae" name="Chymeriae" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-oath-chymeriae-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-oath-chy-rule" name="Chymeriae" hidden="false">
                  <description>Shunned and Distrusted: this force may not include an Allied Detachment. Before deployment choose exactly one Chymeriae Attribute below; it applies to all non-vehicle Blackshield models.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <selectionEntryGroups>
                <selectionEntryGroup id="r71-bs-chy-attrs" name="Chymeriae Attribute — choose exactly one" hidden="false">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="r71-bs-chy-attr-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                    <constraint id="r71-bs-chy-attr-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                  </constraints>
                  <selectionEntries>
                    <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-attr-bulk" name="Gene-Bulked" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="r71-bs-attr-bulk-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
                      </costs>
                      <rules>
                        <rule id="r71-bs-attr-bulk-rule" name="Gene-Bulked" hidden="false">
                          <description>+1 Strength and +1 Toughness; -1 Initiative; reduce Advance and Charge distances by 1 inch; may not Pursue.</description>
                        </rule>
                      </rules>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-attr-wolves" name="Lone Wolves" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="r71-bs-attr-wolves-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
                      </costs>
                      <rules>
                        <rule id="r71-bs-attr-wolves-rule" name="Lone Wolves" hidden="false">
                          <description>+1 Weapon Skill and +1 Ballistic Skill; -2 Leadership.</description>
                        </rule>
                      </rules>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-attr-berserk" name="Berserkers" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="r71-bs-attr-berserk-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
                      </costs>
                      <rules>
                        <rule id="r71-bs-attr-berserk-rule" name="Berserkers" hidden="false">
                          <description>Gain Fear and Fleet; gain +2 Attacks rather than +1 when charging; -1 Ballistic Skill; must always Pursue if able.</description>
                        </rule>
                      </rules>
                    </selectionEntry>
                  </selectionEntries>
                </selectionEntryGroup>
              </selectionEntryGroups>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Allegiance" id="config-allegiance" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="config-allegiance-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
            <constraint id="config-allegiance-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Loyalist" id="allegiance-loyalist" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="allegiance-loyalist-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Allegiance: Loyalist" id="allegiance-loyalist-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>The Detachment has declared Loyalist Allegiance. Apply any unit, character, wargear or Rite of War restrictions which refer to Allegiance.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Traitor" id="allegiance-traitor" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="allegiance-traitor-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Allegiance: Traitor" id="allegiance-traitor-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>The Detachment has declared Traitor Allegiance. Apply any unit, character, wargear or Rite of War restrictions which refer to Allegiance.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
      <selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntries>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-reaver-lord" name="Reaver Lord" type="unit" hidden="false" import="true">
      <modifiers>
        </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="125" />
      </costs>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="r71-bs-reaver-hq" name="HQ" targetId="cat-hq" primary="true" hidden="false" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="r71-bs-reaver-prof" name="Reaver Lord" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+ / 4++</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="r71-bs-reaver-std" name="Standard Wargear" hidden="false">
          <description>Power Armour, Bolt pistol, Chainsword, Frag grenades and Iron Halo.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r71-bs-reaver-la" name="Legiones Astartes (Blackshields)" hidden="false">
          <description>This model has Legiones Astartes (Blackshields).</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r71-bs-reaver-lord-rule" name="Lord of the Blackshields" hidden="false">
          <description>0–1. If included, the Reaver Lord must be the army Warlord.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r71-bs-reaver-retinue-rule" name="Reaver Retinue" hidden="false">
          <description>One Legion Veteran Squad may be selected as his Reaver Retinue without occupying a Force Organisation slot; the Reaver Lord begins attached to it. Alternatively he may use a normal Legion Command Squad or Legion Terminator Command Squad.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r71-bs-reaver-spoils" name="Spoils of War" hidden="false">
          <description>May master-craft one carried weapon for +10 points. May always select Blackshield Wargear and Blackshield Weapons; Xenos items still require an Oath that permits them.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r71-bs-reaver-armour" name="Armour" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-armour-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-reaver-art" name="Artificer Armour" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-art-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" />
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-reaver-term" name="Terminator Armour" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-term-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-reaver-tart" name="Tartaros Terminator Armour" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-tart-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-reaver-cata" name="Cataphractii Terminator Armour" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-cata-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r71-bs-reaver-mob" name="Mobility (not with Terminator Armour)" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-mob-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-reaver-jump" name="Jump Pack" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-jump-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" />
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-reaver-bike" name="Space Marine Bike" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-reaver-bike-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="35" />
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r71-bs-reaver-wargear" name="Blackshield Wargear" hidden="false">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-rad" name="Rad Grenades" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-rad-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-rad-rule" name="Rad Grenades" hidden="false">
                  <description>Enemy models engaged in the same combat count Toughness as 1 lower for To Wound rolls made by the bearer and his unit; does not stack.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-cyber" name="Cyber-familiar" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-cyber-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-cyber-rule" name="Cyber-familiar" hidden="false">
                  <description>Improve the bearer Invulnerable Save by one point; if none, grants 6++; never better than 3++.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-digital" name="Digital Weapons" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-digital-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-digital-rule" name="Digital Weapons" hidden="false">
                  <description>Re-roll one failed To Wound roll made with a close combat attack each Assault phase.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-mastercraft" name="Master-Craft one weapon" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-mastercraft-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-mastercraft-rule" name="Master-Craft one weapon" hidden="false">
                  <description>One weapon carried by the Reaver Lord is Master-Crafted.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r71-bs-reaver-xenos" name="Xenos Wargear (Oath restricted)" hidden="false">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier id="r71-bs-xenos-hide" type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="r71-bs-oath-outlanders" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="r71-bs-oath-alien" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-x-ghost" name="Ghosthelm" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-x-ghost-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-x-ghost-rule" name="Ghosthelm" hidden="false">
                  <description>Librarian only. Perils wound ignored on 3+.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-x-stones" name="Spirit Stones" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-x-stones-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-x-stones-rule" name="Spirit Stones" hidden="false">
                  <description>Librarian only. May attempt one additional Psychic Power each turn; same power not repeated.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r71-bs-x-shadow" name="Shadow Field" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r71-bs-x-shadow-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="30" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r71-bs-x-shadow-rule" name="Shadow Field" hidden="false">
                  <description>0–1 per army; use the supplement rule.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r72-bs-lord-armoury" name="Blackshield Armoury" hidden="false">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-rad" name="Rad Grenades" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-rad-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-rad-rule" name="Rad Grenades" hidden="false">
                  <description>Enemy models engaged in the same combat count Toughness as 1 lower for To Wound rolls made by the bearer and his unit; minimum T1; does not stack.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-cyber" name="Cyber-familiar" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-cyber-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-cyber-rule" name="Cyber-familiar" hidden="false">
                  <description>Improves the bearer’s Invulnerable Save by one point; if none, grants 6+. Cannot improve beyond 3+.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-digital" name="Digital Weapons" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-digital-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-digital-rule" name="Digital Weapons" hidden="false">
                  <description>In each Assault phase the bearer may re-roll one failed To Wound roll made with a close combat attack.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-mind" name="Mind Projector" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-mind-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-mind-rule" name="Mind Projector" hidden="false">
                  <description>When the bearer or joined unit is charged, may use Psychic Repulsion instead of Stand and Shoot: bearer and enemy leader roll D6 + Ld; if bearer scores higher the charge fails. No effect on vehicles, Fearless units or models without Ld; once per Assault phase.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r72-bs-lord-xenos" name="Xenos Wargear — Alien Brotherhood" hidden="false">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier id="r72-bs-xenos-hide" type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="r71-bs-oath-alien" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-x-ghost" name="Ghosthelm" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-x-ghost-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-x-ghost-rule" name="Ghosthelm" hidden="false">
                  <description>Librarian only. Perils wound is ignored on 3+.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-x-stones" name="Spirit Stones" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-x-stones-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-x-stones-rule" name="Spirit Stones" hidden="false">
                  <description>Librarian only. May attempt one additional Psychic Power each turn; same power may not be repeated because of this item.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-x-shadow" name="Shadow Field" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-x-shadow-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="30" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-x-shadow-rule" name="Shadow Field" hidden="false">
                  <description>0–1 per army. Grants 2+ Invulnerable Save; after the first failed save using it, the field collapses for the rest of the battle.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-x-drugs" name="Xenos Combat Drugs" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-x-drugs-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-x-drugs-rule" name="Xenos Combat Drugs" hidden="false">
                  <description>Once per battle at start of an Assault phase choose +1 S, +1 I or +1 A until end of phase; afterward on a 1 bearer suffers one wound with no Armour Save.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="r72-bs-x-tele" name="Deathlock Teleporter" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r72-bs-x-tele-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule id="r72-bs-x-tele-rule" name="Deathlock Teleporter" hidden="false">
                  <description>0–1 per army. When bearer would lose last Wound, on 3+ survives on 1 Wound and teleports Scatter + 4D6, then is Pinned; illegal final position slays bearer. At start of each own turn, on a 1 it activates unexpectedly.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
