      <rules>
        <rule id="r71-bs-chysq-std" name="Unit Composition &amp; Wargear" hidden="false">
          <description>1 Chymeriae Alpha + 4 Chymeriae. Power Armour, Bolt pistol, Chainsword, Frag grenades and Krak grenades. Legiones Astartes (Blackshields).</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r71-bs-instability" name="Genetic Instability" hidden="false">
          <description>At the beginning of each Blackshield turn roll D6: 1 Genetic Collapse: D3 wounds (armour saves allowed) and -1 I; 2 Physiological Degradation: -1 WS/-1 BS; 3 Momentary Stability: no effect; 4 Hyper-Adrenal Response: +1 I and Fleet; 5 Predatory Frenzy: Furious Charge and +1 A, must charge nearest eligible enemy if able; 6 Genetic Ascendancy: +1 S/+1 T/+1 A, then on a 1 at end of turn suffer D3 wounds (armour saves allowed). Effects last until next Blackshield turn and do not accumulate.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
