                          <description>Raven Guard Moritat only. Replaces both Bolt Pistols with two Fulcrum Hand Cannons for +20 points total. Each hand cannon is Range 18 inches, Strength 4, AP4, Pistol, Rending, Concussive and is used with the Moritat's normal Dual Pistols and Chain Fire rules.</description>
                        </rule>
