  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="r72-bs-pariah-bolter-rule" name="Pariah Bolter" hidden="false">
      <description>16" S4 AP5 Assault 2. +2 pts; replaces Bolter. A unit firing one or more may charge, but models in that unit do not receive the normal +1 Attack for charging that turn.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="r72-bs-pariah-flamer-rule" name="Pariah Flamer" hidden="false">
      <description>Template S3 AP5 Assault 1, Overpressure; replaces Flamer. Overpressure: S4 and Gets Hot; narrow end may be placed up to 6" away, pointing away from firer; not usable for Stand and Shoot/Reaction fire.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="r72-bs-deathlock-rule" name="Xenos Deathlock" hidden="false">
      <description>18" S5 AP5 Assault 2, Deathlock, Lethal Exposure; +8 pts; Armoury access replacing Bolter/similar. Wounded enemy tests Ld with -1 per Deathlock wound; failure causes D6 additional wounds with saves. After firing, if 2D6 is lower than Deathlock shots fired, firing unit suffers one wound with no Armour Save.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="bs3-import-rule" name="Blackshield Legion Chassis" hidden="false">
      <description>Generic Legiones Astartes units in this catalogue are imported from the linked Legiones Astartes catalogue. Ignore Legion-specific upgrades that require another Legion identity; Blackshields use the Oath and armoury rules in this catalogue.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>